{"thread":{"threadID":4188,"boardID":117,"topic":"Changelog - 16.02.2017","time":1487215324,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","lastPostTime":1487525087,"lastPoster":"Deagletrix","replies":10,"views":553,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":12},"tags":[{"tagID":210,"name":"changelog"},{"tagID":281,"name":"Community"},{"tagID":207,"name":"csgo"},{"tagID":984,"name":"deutsch"},{"tagID":70,"name":"dream"},{"tagID":1023,"name":"german"},{"tagID":28,"name":"jail"},{"tagID":295,"name":"knife"},{"tagID":106,"name":"mg"},{"tagID":160,"name":"Minigame"},{"tagID":597,"name":"Teamspeak"},{"tagID":197,"name":"TS3"},{"tagID":208,"name":"ttt"}],"posts":[{"postID":61889,"threadID":4188,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"Changelog - 16.02.2017","time":1487215324,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":12,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","time":1487218913,"value":1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1487224893,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1487228883,"value":1},{"userID":2368,"username":"Zelimirus","time":1487235203,"value":1},{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1487237202,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1487239963,"value":1},{"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","time":1487241974,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1487246652,"value":1},{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1487250219,"value":1},{"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","time":1487257246,"value":1},{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1487278042,"value":1},{"userID":262,"username":"Deagletrix","time":1487525097,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<div class=\"message-align\"><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></div><p><br>#nosleepcrew #4uhrmorgens</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>--- Bhop Server ---</strong><br>- The following maps have been added to the server (thanks to <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2523-blade/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@blade</a> for some of the suggestions here):<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>bhop_0</li>\n<li>bhop_asiimov</li>\n<li>bhop_danmark_rg1</li>\n<li>bhop_dream_rg1</li>\n<li>bhop_ika_cirno_9_v9</li>\n<li>bhop_jungle3k_rg1</li>\n<li>bhop_jx</li>\n<li>bhop_khufu</li>\n<li>bhop_major_v2</li>\n<li>bhop_pologos</li>\n<li>bhop_space</li>\n<li>bhop_speedrun_fluid</li>\n<li>bhop_speedrun_habitat_v2</li>\n<li>bhop_xulazu</li>\n<li>bhop_y</li>\n</ul>\n<p>- The next one was requested by <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2288-elroy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Elroy</a> a lot of times ages ago, so it&#x27;s just for you <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span> <br>- Fixed behavior of all slopes to be more consistent<br>- <u><strong>WR Replay Bot</strong></u> was readded and is fully working now! Unfortunately, since this bot was readded only now, it can&#x27;t show runs of world records it didn&#x27;t record. So a new WR has to be made on a map for the bot to work.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>--- Jail Server ---</strong><br>- Folgende Maps wurden auf <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/4174-jail-maps-update/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Vorschlag</a> von <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2106-ifz4ne/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@ifZ4ne</a> dem Jail Server hinzugefügt:<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\nba_2015_minecraft wurde durch ba_2016_minecraft_beta5 ersetzt</li>\n<li>ba_jail_downview_csgo_v3</li>\n<li>ba_jail_sona_sf_v2</li>\n<li>jb_airforce_basic_v0-2b</li>\n<li>jb_canceris_v1</li>\n<li>jb_notch_sly_beta1</li>\n<li>jb_ptz_final2</li>\n<li>jb_tropical_island</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>--- Knife Server ---</strong><br>- Folgende Maps wurden auf <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/4172-ttt-knife-map-vorschlag/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Vorschlag</a> von <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1153-schockly/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Schockly</a> dem Knife Server hinzugefügt:<br></p>\n<ul><li>35hp_chillville</li></ul>\n<p><strong>--- Minigame Server ---</strong><br>- Man hat nun unendlich viel Reservemunition zum Nachladen, vielen Dank für den Vorschlag an <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2356-derxxlmario/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@DerXXLMario</a> <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/4183-mg-server-munition-plugin/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">hier</a>.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>--- TTT Server ---</strong><br>- Folgende Maps wurden auf <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/4172-ttt-knife-map-vorschlag/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Vorschlag</a> von <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1153-schockly/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Schockly</a> dem TTT Server hinzugefügt:<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>ttt_community_pool_csgoport_v6</li>\n<li>ttt_sg_skyfrequency</li>\n<li>ttt_skate</li>\n</ul>","polls":[]},{"postID":61890,"threadID":4188,"userID":2338,"username":"[eXo]","subject":"","time":1487220787,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1487228982,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Schönes Ding <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61891,"threadID":4188,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1487226022,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1487228979,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Gute neue Maps</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61892,"threadID":4188,"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","subject":"","time":1487228937,"lastE